  "summary": "Preinstall downloads Bun runtime to execute bundled obfuscated payload",
  "details": "Package presents itself as a small Babel plugin (~90 lines in lib/index.js) matching the legitimate ornikar/babel-plugin-linaria-css-to-undefined project, but declares a preinstall hook `node setup.mjs` that fetches the Bun runtime from oven-sh's GitHub releases and invokes it via execFileSync to run a bundled 727KB obfuscated file `math_init.js`. `math_init.js` uses shuffled string-array rotation and a custom charset-based decoder to reconstruct strings at runtime, and is unrelated to the advertised Babel-plugin functionality. Execution via a freshly downloaded alien runtime bypasses Node-based tooling and gives the publisher arbitrary code execution on every installer at `npm install` time.",
